がありつつ、甘やかせてくれるような雰囲気/表情\n（もし可能でしたら、表情差分で照れ笑いも頂けたら幸いです...！）\n・服装はラフな部屋着でお願いしたいです。\n（色合いは私のキャラクターに合いそうなカラーにしていただけると嬉しいです！）\n参考画像　https://imgs.julietswhisper.com/uploads/public/604/1a2/8a8/6041a28a839c6681895784.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_600,h_600/quality,q_65\n\n\nまた、透過できるようにpsdでいただけたら嬉しいのですが、\n難しければpngでも大丈夫です...！\n\nSkebのご依頼は初めてなので、失礼がありましたら申し訳ありません...！\nよろしくお願いいたします！", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 174272, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "葦原ヨミ🌄バーチャル日本語サポートAI", "screen_name": "ashihara_yomi", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2032857934674477056/k24xvS3L.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1036491508042485761/1680361330/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 20, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "voice"}, {"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "novel"}, {"genre": "video"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 145}, {"id": 465027, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "千夜イチヤ☪️📜💸癒しと笑いを届ける語り手Vtuber", "screen_name": "senya_1ya", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1895504750013300736/dREXmjHI.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1218234942338912256/1683930542/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "voice"}], "nc": 144}, {"id": 1734765, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "黒咲ノア✒️🐈‍⬛6/10 最後の配信", "screen_name": "kurosaki_noaaa", "avatar_url": "https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/?d=identicon", "header_url": null, "appeal_